title: User Added to Privileged Group
id: e486617b-2985-4505-aa6a-312860642421
status: experimental
description: Detects addition of a member to a security-enabled administrative group (events 4728/4732/4756 for Domain Admins, Enterprise Admins, Administrators), a persistence and privilege-escalation action.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID:
      - 4728
      - 4732
      - 4756
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate group membership changes
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1098
